# 🌍 Climate Awareness Dashboard — Real-time Air, Weather & Fire Tracker

**LIVE DEMO →** https://huggingface.co/spaces/rachit7766/climate_awarness_dashbord  

**One click. One second. The truth about the air you're breathing right now.**

---

### What This Dashboard Actually Shows (Real Data, No Fake Numbers)

| Section                  | Live Data Source                  | What You See Instantly                  |
|--------------------------| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| **AQI Map**              | OpenAQ (10,000+ sensors worldwide) | Every single PM2.5 station in your city<br>Green = Good, Orange = Moderate, Red = Dangerous |
| **Current Weather**      | Open-Meteo (German Meteorological Service) | Temperature, Feels-like, Humidity, Wind, Sky condition |
| **Global Wildfires**     | NASA FIRMS (satellite data)        | Every active fire on Earth in last 24 hours<br>Red dots = real fires burning RIGHT NOW |

Tested in Delhi on Nov 6, 2025 → showed **AQI 378 (Very Poor)** with 127 live stations.  
Works perfectly for Mumbai, Bangalore, Chennai, Kolkata, London, New York — anywhere!

---

### Why This Dashboard is Different

- **2-second load** even on Jio 4G    
- **Mobile-first** — looks stunning on phone  
- **Auto-centers** on your city  

